- **FolderName**: matches by folder name.
- **FilePath**: matches by file path.
- **FileMd5**: matches by file MD5 value.', example='FileSuffix'),
      detail?: string(name='Detail', description='The content of the list entry. The value cannot exceed 255 characters. The meaning is determined by AdditionalType: when AdditionalType is set to FileSuffix, specify a file name extension. When set to FileName, specify a file name. When set to FolderName, specify a folder name. When set to FilePath, specify a file path. When set to FileMd5, specify the MD5 value of a file.', example='.tmp'),
      listType?: string(name='ListType', description='The list type. Valid values:
- **Blacklist**: blacklist. Files that match are directly identified as virus files.
- **Whitelist**: whitelist. Files that match are excluded from virus detection.', example='Whitelist'),
    }
  ](name='AdditionalLists', description='The list of entries to append. At least one entry is required.', position='Body'),
  devType: string(name='DevType', description='The operating system type for which the list takes effect. Valid values:
- **windows**: Windows.
- **macOS**: macOS.

This parameter is required.', example='windows', position='Body'),
}

