This parameter is required.', example='UserGroupNormal', position='Body'),
  maxCpuUsage?: long(name='MaxCpuUsage', description='The maximum percentage of terminal CPU usage during scanning. Valid values: 0 to 100. If this parameter is not specified or is set to 0, the default value based on PerformanceMode is used: 50 for SecurityFirst, 30 for Balance, and 15 for ExperienceFirst.', example='30', position='Body'),
  midRiskOperation: string(name='MidRiskOperation', description='The action to take on medium-risk virus files. Valid values:
