- **ExperienceFirst**: experience first. The default CPU usage limit is 15%.

This parameter is required.', example='Balance', position='Body'),
  priority?: int32(name='Priority', description='The policy priority. A smaller value indicates a higher priority. Valid values: 1 to 100.', example='1', position='Body'),
  scanBeginTime: long(name='ScanBeginTime', description='The start hour for triggering scans, specified as a whole hour. Valid values: 0 to 23 (inclusive). This field is not a timestamp.

This parameter is required.', example='1', position='Body'),
  scanEndTime: long(name='ScanEndTime', description='The end hour for triggering scans, specified as a whole hour. Valid values: 1 to 24 (exclusive of the specified hour). The value must be greater than ScanBeginTime. Scan tasks generated by each trigger expire at this hour on the same day. This field is not a timestamp.

This parameter is required.', example='6', position='Body'),
