- **Custom**: custom path scan. ScanPath is required when this value is specified.

This parameter is required.', example='Quick', position='Body'),
  scanPath?: [ string ](name='ScanPath', description='The collection of custom scan paths. This parameter is required when ScanMode is set to Custom and cannot be specified when ScanMode is set to Quick or Full. A maximum of 100 paths can be specified. Duplicate values are not allowed.', position='Body'),
  scanTargets: [ string ](name='ScanTargets', description='The collection of virus types to be handled in this scan. At least one type must be specified. Duplicate values are not allowed.

This parameter is required.', position='Body'),
  status: string(name='Status', description='The enabling status. Valid values:
- **Enabled**: Enabled.
- **Disabled**: Disabled.

After the policy is enabled, it immediately participates in periodic scheduling. When the policy is disabled, it is only saved and does not trigger scans.

This parameter is required.', example='Enabled', position='Body'),
  strategyDescription?: string(name='StrategyDescription', description='The policy description. The description can contain Chinese characters, uppercase and lowercase letters, digits, spaces, periods (.), commas (,), semicolons (;), forward slashes (/), at signs (@), hyphens (-), and underscores (_).', example='Full disk scan for R&D department terminals every Sunday at midnight', position='Body'),
  strategyName: string(name='StrategyName', description='The policy name. The name can contain Chinese characters, uppercase and lowercase letters, digits, periods (.), underscores (_), and hyphens (-). Spaces are not supported.

This parameter is required.', example='WeeklyScanForRDDept', position='Body'),
  userGroupIds?: [ string ](name='UserGroupIds', description='The collection of user group IDs for the effective scope. This parameter is required when MatchMode is set to UserGroupNormal and cannot be specified when MatchMode is set to UserGroupAll. At least 1 and at most 100 IDs can be specified. Duplicate values are not allowed.', position='Body'),
  whitelist?: [ string ](name='Whitelist', description='The list of exempt users. Users in this list are excluded from the scan triggered by this policy. A maximum of 1000 users can be specified. Duplicate values are not allowed.', position='Body'),
